{"3851340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ScareCrow Hunting VR", "steam_appid": 3851340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The scarecrows have come to life and are running away</strong>. <strong>You are the last line of defence</strong>. <br>Become the guardian of the cornfield – you must be quick, accurate and have eyes in the back of your head <br>to face the scarecrows without fear and defend the Cornline. It's like a return to <strong>the best days </strong><br><strong>of retro gaming</strong>, but with a <strong>modern twist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come face to face with fear</strong> <br><strong>ScareCrow Hunting VR</strong> is a dynamic VR shooter where every second counts. Waves of scarecrows <br>are advancing, and your <strong>accuracy,</strong> <strong>dexterity</strong> <strong>and cunning</strong> are the only things keeping them at bay. <br>Eliminate your opponents with one-shot pistol shots, shower them with bullets using a rifle, <br>or serve them a real <strong>bullet hell</strong> with a rocket launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the best!</strong> <br>Climb to the top of the <strong>leaderboard</strong>! Fight, shoot, be quick. Make your opponents pop like popcorn <br>in a microwave and <strong>become the best</strong> defender of the cornfield in history! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify and have fun</strong> <br><strong>Dozens of maps and different types of weapons</strong>! Choose <strong>gameplay modifications</strong> and beat your own records. <br>It's the perfect game for short, intense sessions - solo or <strong>competing with friends</strong> at your <br>next house party. Show them where fear lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise VR action</strong> - rapid fire, shots under pressure, bullet hell</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack</strong> - each <strong>wave</strong> is more difficult, each <strong>shot</strong> is more important</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable content</strong> - new <strong>maps and weapons</strong> add depth to the gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session modifications</strong> - crank up the risk, have fun, beat your own <strong>records</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> - solid <strong>competition</strong> for the TOP 1 spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylised, slightly surreal setting</strong> – a memorable atmosphere reminiscent of the best days of retro gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be <strong>intimidated</strong>! Join the battle and climb to the <strong>top of the leaderboard</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The scarecrows have come to life and are running away</strong>. <strong>You are the last line of defence</strong>. <br>Become the guardian of the cornfield – you must be quick, accurate and have eyes in the back of your head <br>to face the scarecrows without fear and defend the Cornline. It's like a return to <strong>the best days </strong><br><strong>of retro gaming</strong>, but with a <strong>modern twist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come face to face with fear</strong> <br><strong>ScareCrow Hunting VR</strong> is a dynamic VR shooter where every second counts. Waves of scarecrows <br>are advancing, and your <strong>accuracy,</strong> <strong>dexterity</strong> <strong>and cunning</strong> are the only things keeping them at bay. <br>Eliminate your opponents with one-shot pistol shots, shower them with bullets using a rifle, <br>or serve them a real <strong>bullet hell</strong> with a rocket launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the best!</strong> <br>Climb to the top of the <strong>leaderboard</strong>! Fight, shoot, be quick. Make your opponents pop like popcorn <br>in a microwave and <strong>become the best</strong> defender of the cornfield in history! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify and have fun</strong> <br><strong>Dozens of maps and different types of weapons</strong>! Choose <strong>gameplay modifications</strong> and beat your own records. <br>It's the perfect game for short, intense sessions - solo or <strong>competing with friends</strong> at your <br>next house party. Show them where fear lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise VR action</strong> - rapid fire, shots under pressure, bullet hell</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack</strong> - each <strong>wave</strong> is more difficult, each <strong>shot</strong> is more important</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable content</strong> - new <strong>maps and weapons</strong> add depth to the gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session modifications</strong> - crank up the risk, have fun, beat your own <strong>records</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> - solid <strong>competition</strong> for the TOP 1 spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylised, slightly surreal setting</strong> – a memorable atmosphere reminiscent of the best days of retro gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr